{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >## Basics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. \u25b3         \u2190\u25cf \u2605\t(The star transmits orbs.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. \u25b3/\u25cf\u2192         \u2605\t(Return the orbs with your hands.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. \u25cf\u2191  \u3007\u2193     \t(Avoid orbs of different colors.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >## Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Move Left/Right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Keyboard: \u2190 / \u2192 Arrow Keys or A / D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Gamepad: Left Stick or D-Pad (Left/Right)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Select in Menu &amp; Pause Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Keyboard: Enter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000Gamepad: ABXY Buttons</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >## Hints</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Return as many orbs to the star as you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 Each time you return one, the star gradually regains its light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- When the star is filled with light, it will transmit a new kind of orb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000 (What happens if you return every type in a single playthrough\u2026?)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >## Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- This work uses all 16 pieces from the suite &quot;Pictures at an Exhibition.&quot; (Total 30 minutes)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000The visual representation of each piece is based on the personal impressions and associations of the creator, Sasayaka.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"88 at an Exhibition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3758690/4c3c8b684668ea47ebcc863b334a56dd37020074.jpg"},{"name":"01 at an Exhibition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3758690/c82c5e259a095b0403ef0ab1b1136a189c0cdab4.jpg"},{"name":"00 at an Exhibition","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/